          "settings": {
            "heading": "Working toward B Corp",
            "body": "<p>We are building the business toward B Corp certification. B Corp is a company-level standard, not a product one: an independent body verifies a company's social and environmental performance, its transparency and its accountability across the whole operation. It is deliberately hard to earn.</p>",
            "caveat": "<p>We are working toward certification and are not yet certified. We will only call ourselves certified once we are.</p>",
