        "b_pack": {
          "type": "band",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Packaging",
            "body": "<p>We prioritise aluminium. It can be recycled again and again without losing quality, and recycling it takes around 5% of the energy needed to make it new. Around that, we keep plastic to a minimum rather than claiming to have none. The pump is bamboo and plastic, and is made to be reused. The aim is packaging that does its job protecting the product and then has somewhere sensible to go afterwards.</p>",
            "variant": "plain",
            "set_piece": "none",
            "ethos_icon": "ethos-climate",
            "ethos_label": "Recyclable aluminium bottles, reusable pump"
          }
        },
        "b_range": {
          "type": "band",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A deliberately small range",
            "body": "<p>The range is three textures across five skin types, and each product has to do a real job for a real kind of skin. We do not add products to fill a shelf.</p>",
            "variant": "plain",
            "set_piece": "range_grid",
            "ethos_icon": "none",
            "range_footnote": "Fifteen products: five skin types, three textures."
