        },
        "b_vegan": {
          "type": "band",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Vegan, and cruelty-free",
            "body": "<p>Our products are vegan. They contain no animal-derived ingredients.</p><p>Testing cosmetics on animals is banned by law in the UK and the EU, so cruelty-free is the legal minimum here, and we treat it that way. The only person our products are tested on is the chemist who makes them.</p>",
            "variant": "plain",
            "set_piece": "none",
            "ethos_icon": "ethos-cruelty",
            "ethos_label": "Vegan and cruelty-free"
          }
        },
        "b_suppliers": {
          "type": "band",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The suppliers we choose",
            "body": "<p>We weigh a supplier's standards alongside its price, from where an ingredient comes from to who we sell through. Our bladderwrack infusion, for example, is made in the UK by O&amp;3, cold and without solvents. We have not audited every link in every supply chain, and we do not claim to.</p>",
            "variant": "plain",
            "set_piece": "none",
            "ethos_icon": "ethos-business",
            "ethos_label": "Independent, Devon-based business"
          }
        },
        "b_say": {
          "type": "band",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "And what we say",
            "body": "<p>Transparency belongs on this page too, because how a brand talks is an ethical choice as much as a marketing one. We publish every ingredient and every percentage, and we only make claims the published evidence supports. Those are set out in full on <a href=\"/pages/everything-on-the-label\">everything on the label</a> and <a href=\"/pages/how-we-handle-evidence\">how we handle evidence</a>.</p><p>The more personal side of why the brand exists lives on the <a href=\"/pages/about-us\">about page</a>. This page is the practice behind the principles.</p>",
